"Who changed what and when" becomes: actor from `app.user_id`/`app.user_email`, the diff from `old_data`/`new_data`, the timestamp from `occurred_at`, and the requesting context from `request_id`/`client_ip` — captured for every committed write against every audited table, regardless of which code path or tool produced it, and unmodifiable after the fact.

